{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"fc869f039e021646ad176f69e0790ce0f1b4b3a9da0449ad030d109f8d7f9952","ja":"今日のお仕事はドラマの撮影。\n収録は順調に進んでいたけれど……","zh":"今天的工作是电视剧的拍摄。\n录制进展得十分顺利，但是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7754cd36e16fd9ccb7ed354bde0e5256a60ecf70e4ac3894dc2c007d0c93fc9c","ja":"ジ～～～～～～～～～～……。","zh":"盯～～～～～～～～～～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cc7b7254f1eb2ec57f16450f445bb27fc5202a423d9eed916ffcccabd7537510","ja":"「徳川さん、そろそろ出番なので、\n準備お願いします！」","zh":"“德川小姐，差不多轮到您出场了，\n请做好准备！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3e5e22034e7b18e2c7c370337e96f2f7f9f1070fc3d2554dca5d8796e5a1038d","ja":"あ、スタッフさん。はいなのです。\n呼びに来てくれて、ありがとうなのです。","zh":"啊，工作人员。好的。\n谢谢你来叫我。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2a0d467392d2e2f7e8b10f1493faacf25a32bf553e40ed39143cc1fcd5610542","ja":"あれっ？　桃子ちゃん、\n出番が終わって先に帰ったんじゃなかったの？","zh":"哎？桃子，\n演出结束后不是已经先回去了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"cdc9f0e557f88be6d30ecc4c54b5ed8f23497d9b17c2b6c4aab5c1a447276510","ja":"それに、そんなところに隠れて……どうしたの？","zh":"而且，躲在那种地方……怎么了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"deb3ae0d400afd46a886823baf6fdd477a583f819d941ec8278ca6615b345ea7","ja":"あ、風花さん。\nその……まつりさんを観察してたの。","zh":"啊，风花。\n那个……我正在观察茉莉。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"bbc95008a8fe1450ddc03d4e3ddcdfcd236606a7156cbdbc5c2595a2c3766429","ja":"えっ！？　どうしてそんなことを？","zh":"诶！？为什么要那么做？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0963c06bca203be345e0d9ea08c1701888be955e48398e0eb4d665da7777446f","ja":"それは……。ほ、ほら、この前の公演、風花さんと\nまつりさんは、自分とあまり似てない役だったでしょ？","zh":"那个……你、你看嘛，之前那场公演，风花和\n茉莉演的角色，不是都和自己不太像吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e587611de2e998651e4dd181710100690c2dea1584512f7ea76db961df739433","ja":"そうね。どんな人なのか、なかなかつかめなくて\n役作りが大変だったわ。","zh":"是啊。因为很难把握她究竟是个怎样的人，\n在揣摩角色上花了不少功夫呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1a64b96406077d73e8b501f6dd9e920fb7f9048b6b335ed542d8b98048d7c5ae","ja":"うん！　でもまつりさんは、\n全然、苦労してる様子がなかったの！","zh":"嗯！不过茉莉小姐看起来，\n一点都不辛苦的样子呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"b8bf6ad052d932b88aad771ffbe375eb77e6c23d7d44ce9411bcf4e84887ff94","ja":"そう言われると、\nたしかに余裕があったようにも思うわね。","zh":"这么一说，\n确实感觉当时还挺从容的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"44a6e2cb23c223ac57d01884a594357db560275fd91f71a6526af4a1ff89e72e","ja":"でしょ？　だからまつりさんって、\n演技力がすごく高いんじゃないのかなって！","zh":"对吧？所以我就觉得茉莉小姐的\n演技其实超级厉害的呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"6b2d792e38930fec797a8883f42910ad4625aabc312514ed8095d7bf4003fbf0","ja":"だから今日は、\nまつりさんのことじっくり観察して見極めるんだ！","zh":"所以今天，\n我要好好观察茉莉，把她看个清楚！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1406.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e6fc853dd74453c6e1bba5a9324840940624c1fe27981b1941474aa63ce03574","ja":"そ、そっか……。張り切るのはいいけど\nあんまり無理はしないようにね？","zh":"这、这样啊……干劲十足固然是好事，\n但也千万别太勉强自己哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
